{"id":23027,"name":"驶向第二次生命","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"他仿佛落入深海，一切都离他而去，只余空洞的思维在跳跃与挣扎。\\n\\n恐惧、不安、孤独、黑暗、愤怒…那些感受没有随着肉身消散，反而以另一种方式保留在机械的躯壳之中，愈发沉重。\\n\\n他听到逝者的呼唤，闻到烧焦的气味，电机的嗡鸣在他的耳边盘旋，蓝色的血液流向他饥渴的心脏…一些残忍的记忆再次浮现，刻骨的仇恨化作黑暗中的微光，他循着光亮朝尽头走去，用尽力气浮出了水面。\\n\\n他睁开眼，一簇火花闪过，他听到来自医者的祝贺——\\n<i>「欢迎再次来到这个世界。」 </i>\\n他握紧双手，如今它们是钢铁的，冰冷的……\\n他将不再为自己而活。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23027,"name":"苦航","desc":"使装备者的击破特攻提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，造成的击破伤害无视目标<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>的防御力。当装备者在战斗中击破特攻大于等于<unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak>时，速度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.6,1.5,0.2,0.12]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.7,1.5,0.23,0.14]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.8,1.5,0.26,0.16]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.9,1.5,0.29,0.18]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[1,1.5,0.32,0.2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110191,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110193,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID